WEBVTT

00:00:27.387 --> 00:00:31.777
Kai-Fu was 11 years old when he moved
to America from Taiwan

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:33.975
to be immersed in the US education system.

00:00:33.999 --> 00:00:36.014
And from that point, I guess you could say

00:00:36.038 --> 00:00:39.276
his life has been positioned
to straddle two worlds:

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.172
America and Asia.

00:00:42.141 --> 00:00:44.704
After graduating in computer science,

00:00:44.728 --> 00:00:49.392
Kai-Fu developed a reputation
as a star AI innovator,

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:52.672
and spent time at Apple,
Microsoft and Google.

00:00:53.035 --> 00:00:54.193
But 10 years ago,

00:00:54.217 --> 00:00:56.637
he decided to invest
all of his time and energy

00:00:56.661 --> 00:00:59.164
into China's high-tech companies.

00:00:59.188 --> 00:01:00.586
His motivation?